# lib_audio, a library of ix's tools (mkfiles/mklib): the synthesizer,
# its instruments and effects, ABC, MIDI, MOD, WAV and Ogg Vorbis (the
# playground's Audio over it). Not in it: the MPEG decoders and Player, OCaml's only.
TOP=..
<$TOP/mkfiles/mkconfig
LIB=lib_audio
DIRS=. signal synthesis instruments effects formats/abc formats/wav formats/midi formats/mod formats/vorbis
NEEDS=lib_playground
UNITS=Control Pitch_effect Signal Spectrum Envelope Filter Fm Noise Oscillator Pluck Diode_ladder Modal Moog_ladder \
 Sequencer Svf Vco Voicing Effect Abc Doremi Midi Mod Delay Resample Mix Space Synth Drive Dynamics Wav Paula \
 Mod_player Ogg Vorbis Vorbis_player Sfx Music Instrument Mixer
<$TOP/mkfiles/mklib
